-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
Number of observations              131   ->   524         
Number of variables                   5   ->   3           
j variable (4 values)                     ->   source
xij variables:
         prices_1 prices_2 ... prices_4   ->   prices_
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

. rename prices_ prices

. 
. forvalues x = 1/4 {
  2.         sum prices if source == `x'
  3.         local mean_`x' = string(r(mean), "%9.1fc")
  4. }

